msgid "To cancel every open order at once, `POST /matcher/orderbook/cancel` takes `{\"sender\": <public key>, \"timestamp\": <ms>, \"signature\": <signature of the public key bytes and the big-endian timestamp>}`."
msgstr "प्रत्येक खुले क्रम को एक बार में रद्द करने के लिए, `POST /matcher/orderbook/cancel` `{\"sender\": <public key>, \"timestamp\": <ms>, \"signature\": <signature of the public key bytes and the big-endian timestamp>}` लेता है।"

#: ../../04_building-apps/12_matcher-api.md:97
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`GET /matcher/orderbook/{amountAsset}/{priceAsset}/tradableBalance/{address}` is public: it returns how much of each asset of the pair the address can still put into new orders."
msgstr "`GET /matcher/orderbook/{amountAsset}/{priceAsset}/tradableBalance/{address}` सार्वजनिक है: यह रिटर्न देता है कि प्रत्येक परिसंपत्ति का कितना पता अभी भी नए आदेशों में डाल सकता है।"

