#: ../../04_building-apps/sdk/01_typescript.md:85
msgid "Each package's README in [`packages/sdk`](https://github.com/Decentral-America/DecentralChain/tree/main/packages/sdk) documents its full API. Report bugs in the [monorepo's issue tracker](https://github.com/Decentral-America/DecentralChain/issues)."
